{"title":"Meta Quest VR","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"dobe-fast-charging-dock-with-rechargable-battery-pack-for-oculus-quest-2-vr-controllers","title":"DOBE Fast Charging Dock  with Rechargable Battery Pack for Meta Quest 2 VR Controllers","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e5V\/2A Fast Charge:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cbr\u003eOculus Quest 2 controllers can be fully charged in approximately four hours.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOvercharge Protection:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cbr\u003eBuilt-in smart chip protects Oculus Quest 2 controllers from overcharging, overheating, and short circuiting\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLED Indicator Light:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cbr\u003eIntimate LED light design lets you know the current charging status more clearly. Red for charging and green for fully charged\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat you get:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cbr\u003e1*Charging Dock, 1*USB to Type-C Charging Cable, 2*Rechargeable Controller Batteries, 2*Custom Controller Skins, 1*User Manual\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNote: 5V\/2A power adapter is required, but not included)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dobe","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42563721855198,"sku":"","price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1647027296647.jpg?v=1687054240"},{"product_id":"kiwi-design-vr-stand-for-oculus-quest-quest-2-rift-rift-s-go-htc-vive-vive-pro-valve-index-vr-headset-and-controllers","title":"KIWI design VR Stand for PS VR2 \u0026 Meta Quest 2\/3\/3s VR Headset and Controllers","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"kiwi design\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/f069bccd-5525-4dae-8db6-253749990d31.__CR0,0,600,180_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\" class=\"\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/ima