e they're on the stand\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e+ Keeps your these expensive equipment of VR headsets and controllers safe\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-8 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-8\" data-csa-c-id=\"dvu3ka-elz3ud-zfn8r3-oki3hk\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"vr stand\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/14c56894-52f7-46bd-9265-8f1f162c8012.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/14c56894-52f7-46bd-9265-8f1f162c8012.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eKIWI design VR Stand (S2)\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch5 class=\"a-spacing-mini a-color-secondary\"\u003eMake Your VR Setup Neat \u0026amp; Secure\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eClean design with an unique sponge non-slip design and a strong textured round base, this nice sturdy stand organizes your VR equipments and give your decent VR Setup a secure, stylish home.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5 class=\"a-spacing-mini a-color-secondary\"\u003eUniversal Compatibility:\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eFor Oculus Go\/Rift\/Rift S\/Quest\/Quest 2 and controllers\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eFor HTC Vive\/Vive Pro and controllers\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eFor Valve Index and controllers\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eFor Google Daydream and controllers\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eFor Samsung Gear VR and controllers\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eWhat will you get?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-box a-spacing-small a-color-alternate-background apm-listbox\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-box-inner\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-size-base\"\u003e1*Base\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-size-base\"\u003e1*Pallet\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-size-base\"\u003e2*Strut\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-size-base\"\u003e1*Strap hanger\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-size-base\"\u003e2*Controller holders\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-size-base\"\u003e2*Controller hangers\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-size-base\"\u003e1*User Manual\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-6 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-6\" data-csa-c-id=\"gc3j97-3gokdh-7en3jb-klr0au\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-6\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"vr stand\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/c93d5c1e-67de-44f8-807c-da0f6ba15862.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/c93d5c1e-67de-44f8-807c-da0f6ba15862.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eTake Care of Your VR Strap\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eJust stretch your VR strap as what it should be with this Strap hanger. Fix your head-mounted display (HMD) securely on the pallet at the same time.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"vr stand\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/e344a390-bc6a-4dd5-8d48-9ffc14d324b5.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/e344a390-bc6a-4dd5-8d48-9ffc14d324b5.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eLenses Protection\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eThis wide pallet for displaying and storing your VR headsets, keeps an appropriate distance with the pillar, so no contact with the lenses and you don't need to worry about scratching.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"vr stand\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/15857e6b-8fbd-4363-bbb7-16e83772a2a4.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/15857e6b-8fbd-4363-bbb7-16e83772a2a4.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eController Hangers\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eEasily to place and fetch your Oculus Quest 2\/ Quest \/Go\/Rift\/Rift S\/Valve Index controllers, makes your desktop neat and tidy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"vr stand\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/a2966b38-eb29-41e1-a32f-5bd6f270eb8d.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/a2966b38-eb29-41e1-a32f-5bd6f270eb8d.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eController Holders\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eVery useful for holding your HTC Vive\/Vive Pro\/Samsung Gear VR controllers, make it looks nicer than having them on the table.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"KIWI Design","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42590689296606,"sku":"","price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1647807509909.jpg?v=1687054295"},{"product_id":"silicone-cover-set-for-oculus-quest-2","title":"Protective Kit for Meta Quest 2","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eAll In One Cover Set: What You Get:1*VR Headset Protective Shell, 2*Silicone Controller Covers, 2*Controller Shakes Stick Cap, 1*Face Cover, 1*Lens Cover, 1*Lens Cleaning Cloths.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eOculus Quest 2 Accessories: The Cover Set for Oculus Quest 2 fits flawlessly and tight. Protects it from drops or scratches, Also it keeps it from getting dirty! The silicone is MUCH easier to clean than the white plastic of the oculus itself.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eCool Addition To Oculus: The Protective cover is very easy to install and the cutouts sit perfectly over all sensors and buttons, It will not Block the sense. With 4 colors to choose from, Which adds a nice stylish touch and true protection for your device.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eController Grip Cover: The silicone is buttery soft and makes the controllers very comfortable to hold! Grips can be adjusted (for multiple users), Solving the problem with the controllers flying off the kid's or small hands, saved your controllers from various hits and fall\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eComfortable face Cover: Face cover is made of soft silicone material, Solving the problem of smell coming off the original factory foam, worked well for keeping sweat off of the stock pad. No light leaking through makes the experience more immersive.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eProtective Shell cover: Protective shell cover fits the Quest snuggly, protecting the headset from the dings, drop, and scratches. Holes in all the right places for the sensors and cameras. and has the slits on the top bottom and side to properly allow airflow threw the oculus.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":43695099642078,"sku":"","price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":43695099674846,"sku":"","price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Purple","offer_id":43695099707614,"sku":"","price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/products\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1669243028938.jpg?v=1669243248"},{"product_id":"oc","title":"Controller Grip Cover with Handle for Meta Quest 2","description":"\u003col class=\"a-ordered-list a-vertical\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003eController Grip cover completely solves the problem of accidentally throwing your controllers into the room, and also provides a better protection for your controllers.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThe Elastic Knuckle Strap is adjustable, so you can share with your friends with different hand sizes and increase immersion, because you can completely release your controllers without dropping.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThe texture design of the controller grip cover can increase the friction force and provide better grip for the hand, and the texture helps the air flow to easily drain the sweat from your hand,which is non-slip, durable, and comfortable to enhance your game enjoyment\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Red","offer_id":43695121137886,"sku":"","price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":43695121170654,"sku":"","price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black","offer_id":43695121203422,"sku":"","price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"White","offer_id":43695121236190,"sku":"","price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/products\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1669244333331.jpg?v=1669244982"},{"product_id":"meta-quest-3-128gb","title":"Meta Quest 3 All-In-One Mixed Reality Headset and Controllers - 128GB","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eDive into extraordinary experiences with a mixed reality headset that transforms your home into an exciting new playground, where virtual elements blend into your actual surroundings.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eIt’s the most powerful Quest yet*, featuring next-level performance with more than double the graphic processing power of Quest 2. (*Based on the graphic performance of the Snapdragon XR2 Gen 2 vs Meta Quest 2.)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eExperience more immersion with dazzling visuals with the 4K+ Infinite Display (a nearly 30% leap in resolution from Quest 2) and rich 3D audio with enhanced sound clarity, bass performance and a 40% louder volume range than Quest 3\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eReach out and touch virtual worlds with Touch Plus controllers that give you fine-tuned precision, realistic sensations and more intuitive interactions. You can even navigate without controllers with Direct Touch that follows your gestures, so you can use just your hands to find your way.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eExplore the world’s best library of 500+ immersive apps and find your favorite content across gaming, fitness, wellness, entertainment, social experiences and more.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eGet up to 2.2 hours of usage on average with the option to extend your battery life further with Battery Saver mode. Use the included 18W power adapter to fully charge your headset.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePlay what you love longer with maximum comfort. Personalize your fit with added customization and a redesigned slimmer profile compared to Quest 2.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eEveryone in the family is safe to explore with privacy features and supervision tools. Meta Quest is for ages 13+.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Meta","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44442352910558,"sku":"","price":500.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid-Plus_1698096800419.jpg?v=1698097361"},{"product_id":"meta-quest-3-all-in-one-mixed-reality-headset-and-controllers-512gb","title":"Meta Quest 3 All-In-One Mixed Reality Headset and Controllers - 512GB","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eDive into extraordinary experiences with a mixed reality headset that transforms your home into an exciting new playground, where virtual elements blend into your actual surroundings.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eIt’s the most powerful Quest yet*, featuring next-level performance with more than double the graphic processing power of Quest 2. (*Based on the graphic performance of the Snapdragon XR2 Gen 2 vs Meta Quest 2.)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eExperience more immersion with dazzling visuals with the 4K+ Infinite Display (a nearly 30% leap in resolution from Quest 2) and rich 3D audio with enhanced sound clarity, bass performance and a 40% louder volume range than Quest 3\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eReach out and touch virtual worlds with Touch Plus controllers that give you fine-tuned precision, realistic sensations and more intuitive interactions. You can even navigate without controllers with Direct Touch that follows your gestures, so you can use just your hands to find your way.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eExplore the world’s best library of 500+ immersive apps and find your favorite content across gaming, fitness, wellness, entertainment, social experiences and more.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eGet up to 2.2 hours of usage on average with the option to extend your battery life further with Battery Saver mode. Use the included 18W power adapter to fully charge your headset.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePlay what you love longer with maximum comfort. Personalize your fit with added customization and a redesigned slimmer profile compared to Quest 2.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eEveryone in the family is safe to explore with privacy features and supervision tools. Meta Quest is for ages 13+.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Meta","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44571024851166,"sku":"","price":610.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid-Plus_1698096800419_3696bfba-a52c-448a-a492-46160de61cf1.jpg?v=1701378415"},{"product_id":"cable-creation-16ft-5m-optic-link-cable-for-meta-quest-2-meta-quest-3","title":"Cable Creation 16FT\/5M Optic Link Cable For Meta Quest 2 \u0026 Meta Quest 3","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"1064\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/d93a610a-3fdd-4228-9ded-ff18f1343c97.__CR257,47,1667,500_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\" class=\"\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/d93a610a-3fdd-4228-9ded-ff18f1343c97.__CR257,47,1667,500_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-v2 mobile celwidget\" cel_widget_id=\"m-aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"fwnlv5-w4z7sa-bd951i-81ui6k\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-1 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-1\" data-csa-c-id=\"w9aox6-wikj5z-2xmal5-1rrp5a\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eFiber Optic Cable\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"apm-spacing apm-wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"apm-wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"CableCreation\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/bf64646d-d18b-402d-b8da-aacc9a54ee7b.__CR0,100,400,200_PT0_SX350_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/bf64646d-d18b-402d-b8da-aacc9a54ee7b.__CR0,100,400,200_PT0_SX350_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-small a-size-small a-color-secondary\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-bold\"\u003eRight-angled design\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eperfectly for VR headsets, which does not stick out and provides you a comfortable grip; the 90 degree angle USB C male port connect with you VR Headset,the another USB C male port connect with your PC.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-bold\"\u003e16F\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003eLink Cable is long enough that allows you to move freely without restricted when you enjoying in the VR Gaing world.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-bold\"\u003e10Gbps\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003eoffer exceptional performance, fast transmission speed, low latency and minimum signal loss.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c