ission speed, low latency and minimum signal loss,offer exceptional performance while playing your VR gaming without distortion. Cable‘s weight only 195g\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e16FT Long Distance: 16ft for Oculus Quest 2 link cable is long enough that allows you to move freely without restricted,flexible, durability and lightweight,you can enjoy your VR gaming time or movies,more better experience\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eAngled \u0026amp; Lightweight: 90-degree right-angled design, easy to insert into your Quest's USB C port, and effectively prevents disconnecting during gaming, which also reduce bending for a longer lifespan and avoid becoming an obstruction; Easy to insert into the VR headset and prevents from disconnecting during movements\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eWhat You’ll Get: 1x USB C to USB C Fiber Optic Link Cable16 ft + 2 x Cable Straps. If you have any questions about our product, please don’t hesitate to contact us at any time, CableCreation offers 24-month product warranty, lifetime technical support and easy to reach 7\/24 friendly customer service.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eCableCreation advantage - The premium material used in the production of our CableCreation items, we tested with other's item, and we are sure it provides a greater degree of cable durability, stability and long life, when you use our cable with playing gaming, it will more smoother\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Cable Creation","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44571042283742,"sku":"","price":25.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_3d1c48d3-5b5c-4a7a-93dd-b0e7e948a77e.jpg?v=1741249974"},{"product_id":"dobe-storage-case-for-meta-quest-2-meta-quest-3","title":"Dobe Storage Case For Meta Quest 2 \u0026 Meta Quest 3\/3s","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDOBE TY-3817 For Meta Oculus Quest 2\u0026amp;3 \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMade of high-quality EVA material, hard, impact-resistant and anti-drop\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAnti-slip surface, frosted design, comfortable to touch\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSmooth dual-way zipper, easy to pull, rust-proof and durable\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eoffers great security and portability to carry around whether you're at home or on the go\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dobe","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45296671686878,"sku":"","price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid-Plus_1714422603769.jpg?v=1714423130"},{"product_id":"pgtech-hard-protective-case-for-meta-quest-3","title":"PGTECH Hard Protective Case for Meta Quest 3\/3s","description":"","brand":"PGTECH","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45296831267038,"sku":"","price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid-Plus_1714424199002.jpg?v=1714424689"},{"product_id":"meta-quest-3s-mixed-reality-headset-conttollets-256-gb","title":"Meta Quest 3S Mixed Reality Headset \u0026 Controllers - 256GB","description":"\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e256GB  – 8GB RAM\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSnapdragon XR2 Gen 2\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4.5X Visual Resolution\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTruTouch Haptics\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"productView-title\"\u003eMeta Quest 3S Mixed Reality Headset – Snapdragon XR2 Gen 2 – 4.5X Visual Resolution – TruTouch Haptics\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Meta Quest 3S Mixed Reality Headset is an advanced device designed for immersive experiences, powered by the Snapdragon XR2 Gen 2 processor. It boasts an impressive 4.5X visual resolution, enhancing clarity and detail for both virtual and augmented reality applications.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOne of its standout features is TruTouch Haptics, which provides realistic tactile feedback, making interactions more engaging and lifelike.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re exploring virtual worlds, playing games, or engaging with augmented reality content, the Quest 3S delivers a seamless blend of digital and physical experiences, ensuring users are fully immersed in their environments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith its ergonomic design and enhanced performance, the Quest 3S is ideal for gamers, developers, and anyone looking to explore the potential of mixed reality.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMeta Quest 3S Snapdragon XR2 Gen 2 Chipset\u003c\/strong\u003e: Faster performance, enhanced visuals, and smoother gameplay.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCrisp Visuals\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1832 x 1920 resolution with 773 PPI and a 100% sRGB color gamut for vibrant, realistic visuals.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMixed Reality Integration\u003c\/strong\u003e: Transforms environments, blending the physical and digital worlds with seamless precision.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHand and Controller Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Hybrid tracking system powered by computer vision and machine learning, supporting hand-tracking and TruTouch variable haptics for greater immersion.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eErgonomic Design\u003c\/strong\u003e: Soft strap design with hard strap availability and a glasses spacer for added comfort and flexibility.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: Powered by a 4324 mAh battery for up to 2.5 hours of uninterrupted usage.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Meta","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46003575455966,"sku":"","price":450.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/1-103.jpg?v=1730497206"},{"product_id":"meta-quest-3s-mixed-reality-headset-conttollets-128gb","title":"Meta Quest 3S Mixed Reality Headset \u0026 Controllers - 128GB","description":"\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e128GB  – 8GB RAM\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSnapdragon XR2 Gen 2\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4.5X Visual Resolution\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTruTouch Haptics\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"productView-title\"\u003eMeta Quest 3S Mixed Reality Headset – Snapdragon XR2 Gen 2 – 4.5X Visual Resolution – TruTouch Haptics\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Meta Quest 3S Mixed Reality Headset is an advanced device designed for immersive experiences, powered by the Snapdragon XR2 Gen 2 processor. It boasts an impressive 4.5X visual resolution, enhancing clarity and detail for both virtual and augmented reality applications.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOne of its standout features is TruTouch Haptics, which provides realistic tactile feedback, making interactions more engaging and lifelike.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re exploring virtual worlds, playing games, or engaging with augmented reality content, the Quest 3S delivers a seamless blend of digital and physical experiences, ensuring users are fully immersed in their environments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith its ergonomic design and enhanced performance, the Quest 3S is ideal for gamers, developers, and anyone looking to explore the potential of mixed reality.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMeta Quest 3S Snapdragon XR2 Gen 2 Chipset\u003c\/strong\u003e: Faster performance, enhanced visuals, and smoother gameplay.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCrisp Visuals\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1832 x 1920 resolution with 773 PPI and a 100% sRGB color gamut for vibrant, realistic visuals.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMixed Reality Integration\u003c\/strong\u003e: Transforms environments, blending the physical and digital worlds with seamless precision.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHand and Controller Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Hybrid tracking system powered by computer vision and machine learning, supporting hand-tracking and TruTouch variable haptics for greater immersion.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eErgonomic Design\u003c\/strong\u003e: Soft strap design with hard strap availability and a glasses spacer for added comfort and flexibility.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: Powered by a 4324 mAh battery for up to 2.5 hours of uninterrupted usage.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Meta","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46003624050910,"sku":null,"price":370.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/1-103.jpg?v=1730497206"},{"product_id":"7-in-1-accessory-kit-for-meta-quest-3","title":"7 in 1 Accessory Kit For Meta Quest 3 \u0026 Meta Quest 3s","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【Comprehensive Protection】: This 7-piece accessory set is specially designed for the new generation Meta Quest 3, providing dustproof, shockproof and scratchproof protection. This accessory is washable and reusable, with a soft and lightweight texture, providing effective protection for your VR device.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【VR Protective Cover Set includes】: 1 * Host Cover, 1 * Face Mask, 2 * Grip Handle Covers, 2 * Button Caps, 1 * Lens Cover, 1 * Eye Mask, and 1 * Cleaning Cloth. Please note that the VR headset, controller and other accessories are not included.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【TPU Host Cover Protection】: Made of high quality TPU material, this host cover provides drop and slip resistance. It does not need to be removed, allowing seamless charging and use of basic functions. With its four-sided breathability, it provides optimal heat dissipation and maintains the performance of your VR headset while gaming.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【TPU Grip Grips】: These grip covers are made of high-quality TPU and feature non-slip textures for an aesthetic and comfortable grip. Thanks to the precise openings, there is no delay in using the grip covers. Also, two silicone caps for the buttons are included to reduce finger pressure when pressing the buttons frequently, delaying fatigue and improving the gaming experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【TPU Face Mask and Sweatproof Eye Mask】: Made of high quality TPU, this face mask offers a soft and smooth texture to cushion the pressure on the facial skin. It is non-irritating and reusable.Eye mask made of elastic fabric, comfortable to wear, moisture-wicking fabric keeps face and ears dry.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dobe","offers":[{"title":"Meta Quest 3 \/ Black","offer_id":46602683220190,"sku":null,"price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Meta Quest 3 \/ Blue","offer_id":46602683252958,"sku":null,"price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Meta Quest 3 \/ Pink","offer_id":46602683285726,"sku":null,"price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false},{"title":"Meta Quest 3 \/ White","offer_id":46602683318494,"sku":null,"price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Meta Quest 3 \/ Red","offer_id":46602683351262,"sku":null,"price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false},{"title":"Meta Quest 3s \/ Black","offer_id":47479577608414,"sku":null,"price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Meta Quest 3s \/ Blue","offer_id":47479577641182,"sku":null,"price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Meta Quest 3s \/ Pink","offer_id":47479577673950,"sku":null,"price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Meta Quest 3s \/ White","offer_id":47479577706718,"sku":null,"price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Meta Quest 3s \/ Red","offer_id":47479577739486,"sku":null,"price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_aab4beee-fd9d-40d4-8c91-4e470d88e3c8.jpg?v=1756460334"},{"product_id":"kiwi-design-k4-comfort-head-strap-for-meta-quest-3-3s","title":"Kiwi Design K4 Comfort Head Strap For Meta Quest 3\/3s","description":"\u003csection id=\"shopify-section-template--16611985064049__main\" class=\"shopify-section shopify-section--main-product\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section section--tight  section-blends section-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product showBackinstock\"\u003e\u003csafe-sticky class=\"product-info\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product-info__description\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"prose\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003efor Quest 3\/3S\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUnmatched Comfort\u003c\/strong\u003e: Adaptive headrest cradles the back of your head for a truly immersive MR experience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHigh-Quality Materials\u003c\/strong\u003e: Features upgraded memory foam, a widened top strap, and soft PU leather to relieve pressure and ensure durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUser-Friendly\u003c\/strong\u003e: Quick-detachable pivot with dampener allows smooth adjustments from 0° to 52°; easy to wear and remove, ideal for glasses wearers.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFit Anywhere, Anytime\u003c\/strong\u003e: Adjustment knob seamlessly integrated into the head strap; make adjustments for a perfect fit whether lounging or lying down, enhancing your gaming or movie experience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGame On, All Day Long\u003c\/strong\u003e: Slimmer, stronger, and better balanced; more portable head strap, ensuring a stress-free wearing experience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/safe-sticky\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection id=\"shopify-section-template--16611985064049__video_WFfWew\" class=\"shopify-section shopify-section--video\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section   section-blends section-full text-custom\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"content-over-media  shadow-block rounded-lg  text-custom\"\u003e\u003cvideo-media host=\"youtube\" loaded=\"\" can-play=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/KIWI_design_K4_d10410fc-f581-47c5-8755-dcb3ad5e1b45.jpg?v=1726019086\u0026amp;width=2560\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"\/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/KIWI_design_K4_d10410fc-f581-47c5-8755-dcb3ad5e1b45.jpg?v=1726019086\u0026amp;width=200 200w, \/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/KIWI_design_K4_d10410fc-f581-47c5-8755-dcb3ad5e1b45.jpg?v=1726019086\u0026amp;width=300 300w, \/\