- 40px), (max-width: 999px) calc(100vw - 64px), min(1600px, 100vw - 96px)\"\u003e\u003c\/picture\u003e\u003c\/image-banner\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection id=\"shopify-section-template--16611985064049__1728695851994be400\" class=\"shopify-section shopify-section--apps\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section   section-blends section-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"shopify-block-ATlNJajU4MkZ1bDRuU__specification_compare_comparison_table_pYLcPR\" class=\"shopify-block shopify-app-block sc-app-block\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e","brand":"KIWI Design","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46637481099486,"sku":"","price":35.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_16814eb4-e114-424a-ae61-7eb4276e43c2.jpg?v=1745533319"},{"product_id":"kiwi-design-k4-boost-battery-head-strap-for-meta-quest-3-3s","title":"Kiwi Design K4 Boost Battery Head Strap For Meta Quest 3\/3s","description":"\u003csection id=\"shopify-section-template--16611984998513__main\" class=\"shopify-section shopify-section--main-product\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section section--tight  section-blends section-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product showBackinstock\"\u003e\u003csafe-sticky class=\"product-info\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product-info__description\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"prose\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003efor Quest 3\/3S\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eExtended Play:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eKeep the MR sessions going with 3 extra hours of battery life. Optimized for peak performance based on your gaming needs.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDual Fast Charging, Twice the Speed:\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eSimultaneously charge the K4 Boost and your Quest 3S\/3 with the DualBoost Power system.\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eFully recharge both in just 2.5 hours with a 45W adapter\u003c\/strong\u003e, delivering 25W power to your Quest 3S\/3 while charging the internal battery.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eComfort and Balance:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eErgonomically designed rear headrest with thickened padding reduces facial pressure, while enhanced counterweight eases strain on your head and neck.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSafe and Reliable:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eThe premium-certified batteries and system are credited with multiple protections, including essential UL, EN, and FCC certifications. Every material is rigorously tested in TÜV labs for safety and durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Wear and Quick Adjustment:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eThe 52° damping hinge allows easy on and off, while the quick adjustment knob ensures a perfect fit.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/safe-sticky\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection id=\"shopify-section-template--16611984998513__video_tMTYtz\" class=\"shopify-section shopify-section--video\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section   section-blends section-full text-custom\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"content-over-media  shadow-block rounded-lg  text-custom\"\u003e\u003cvideo-media host=\"youtube\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/20240925-230358.jpg?v=1727276673\u0026amp;width=1600\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"\/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/20240925-230358.jpg?v=1727276673\u0026amp;width=200 200w, \/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/20240925-230358.jpg?v=1727276673\u0026amp;width=300 300w, \/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/20240925-230358.jpg?v=1727276673\u002