able-scroller is-scrollable\"\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"comparison-table table table--stack-narrow table--same-colors \"\u003e\n\u003ccaption class=\"sr-only\"\u003eSpecification comparison between products K4 Boost Battery Strap, H4 Boost Halo Battery Strap, K4 Comfort Strap\u003c\/caption\u003e\n\u003cthead class=\"row-group row-group--head\"\u003e\n\u003ctr class=\"row row--product\"\u003e\n\u003cth scope=\"col\" class=\"column-header\" aria-label=\"K4 Boost Battery Strap\"\u003e\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth scope=\"col\" class=\"column-header\" aria-label=\"H4 Boost Halo Battery Strap\"\u003e\u003csc-product class=\"product\" product-handle=\"h4-boost-halo-battery-strap\" product-id=\"7237401247857\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"relative\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/sc-product\u003e\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/thead\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e\n\u003c\/sc-scrollable\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/sc-comparison-table\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e","brand":"KIWI Design","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46637487489246,"sku":"","price":65.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_2b9382fa-b7bf-42da-98df-b1c6b26f215f.jpg?v=1745534581"},{"product_id":"kiwi-design-5-meter-link-cable-with-cable-clip-for-meta-quest-2-3-3s-pro-pico-4","title":"Kiwi Design 5 meter Link Cable with Cable Clip For Meta Quest 2\/3\/3s\/Pro\/Pico 4","description":"\u003csection id=\"shopify-section-template--16611985719409__main\" class=\"shopify-section shopify-section--main-product\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section section--tight  section-blends section-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product showBackinstock\"\u003e\u003csafe-sticky class=\"product-info\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product-info__description\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"prose\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCompatible with Quest 3\/2\/1\/Pro and Pico 4:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003econnect your headset to a gaming PC for seamless PC VR gaming; refer to A+ content for usage tips\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCable Clip Included:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eComes with a customized cable clip to attach the link cable securely to the side strap of most third-party head straps; ensures a stable connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePremium Construction\u003c\/strong\u003e: Durable aluminum head and tinplate casing improve pull-resistance; designed for VR\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOptimal Length and Flexibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e16ft length provides flexibility and lightweight durability\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHigh-Speed Data Transfer:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eSupports up to 5 Gbps data transfer and 3A power; charges your headset during use; charging speed varies by output power\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/safe-sticky\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection id=\"shopify-section-template--16611985719409__image_with_text_overlay_G3Ym3w\" class=\"shopify-section shopify-section--image-with-text-overlay\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section   section-blends section-full text-custom\"\u003e\u003cimage-banner reveal-on-scroll=\"true\" class=\"content-over-media content-over-media--auto shadow-block rounded-lg  text-custom\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(max-width: 699px)\" srcset=\"\/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/Quest_2_link_cable_A__1.jpg?v=1681808339\u0026amp;width=400 400w, \/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/Quest_2_link_cable_A__1.jpg?v=1681808339\u0026amp;width=600 600w, \/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/Quest_2_link_cable_A__1.jpg?v=1681808339\u0026am