rs \/ charging the battery is approximately 5 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAutomatic detection and protection. Automatically detects charging current and optimizes to prevent overcurrent protection and ensure safe charging.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dobe","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47647970263262,"sku":null,"price":25.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_d0149e60-3e50-48f4-af8d-ca8d6ebfab39.jpg?v=1761948125"},{"product_id":"dobe-charging-dock-for-meta-quest-2-meta-quest-3-meta-quest-3s-ty-3867","title":"Dobe Charging Dock for Meta Quest 2 \/ Meta Quest 3 \/ Meta Quest 3S TY-3867","description":"\u003csection data-section-id=\"product-template\" data-section-type=\"product\" data-section-settings='{\n  \"showShippingEstimator\": false,\n  \"showQuantitySelector\": true,\n  \"showPaymentButton\": false,\n  \"showInventoryQuantity\": true,\n  \"lowInventoryThreshold\": 0,\n  \"galleryTransitionEffect\": \"fade\",\n  \"enableImageZoom\": true,\n  \"enableImageZoomOnClick\": true,\n  \"zoomEffect\": \"outside\",\n  \"enableVideoLooping\": false,\n  \"productOptions\": [\"Title\"],\n  \"enableHistoryState\": true,\n  \"infoOverflowScroll\": true,\n  \"isQuickView\": false\n}'\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"container container--flush\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product-block-list\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product-block-list__item product-block-list__item--description\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"card\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"card__header\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"card__title heading h3\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0355\/8296\/7943\/files\/Layer_7_d87aee20-f8eb-4a92-b44d-adfa09f63c9c.jpg?v=1743822209\"\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"card__section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"rte text--pull\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"\" data-end=\"167\" data-start=\"0\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong data-end=\"40\" data-start=\"4\"\u003eDobe Retractable Bracket for PS5\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e(Model: TP5-3531) is designed to provide a neat and space-saving solution for mounting your PS5 console. Key features include:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"251\" data-start=\"171\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"193\" data-start=\"171\"\u003eRetractable Design\u003c\/strong\u003e: Adjustable to fit the PS5, saving space when not in use.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"337\" data-start=\"254\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"277\" data-start=\"254\"\u003eSturdy Construction\u003c\/strong\u003e: Built with durable materials to securely hold the console.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"399\" data-start=\"340\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"354\" data-start=\"340\"\u003eEasy Setup\u003c\/strong\u003e: Simple installation with no tools required.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"484\" data-start=\"402\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"425\" data-start=\"402\"\u003eVentilation Support\u003c\/strong\u003e: Designed to allow proper airflow, preventing overheating.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"552\" data-start=\"487\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"503\" data-start=\"487\"\u003eSpace-Saving\u003c\/strong\u003e: Helps keep your gaming area organized and tidy.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/www.dobe-game.com\/uploads\/image\/20240915\/1726397337.jpg\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/www.dobe-game.com\/uploads\/image\/20240915\/1726392826.jpg\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/www.dobe-game.com\/uploads\/image\/20240915\/1726389232.jpg\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/www.dobe-game.com\/uploads\/image\/20240915\/1726394002.jpg\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/www.dobe-game.com\/uploads\/image\/20240915\/1726390869.jpg\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e","brand":"Dobe","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47647976456414,"sku":null,"price":25.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_bb1cbdca-cdb4-457a-8403-c387cdc6af65.jpg?v=1761948483"},{"product_id":"dobe-adjustable-head-strap-rechargeable-battery-18500mwh-for-meta-quest-3-meta-quest-3s-ty-3878","title":"Dobe Adjustable Head Strap \u0026 Rechargeable Battery 18500mWh for Meta Quest 3 \/ Meta Quest 3S TY-3878","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Dobe Adjustable Head Strap \u0026amp; Rechargeable Battery (18500mWh) for Meta Quest 3 \/ Meta Quest 3S (Model TY-3878) offers enhanced comfort and extended playtime. Key features include:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdjustable head strap for a secure and comfortable fit.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIntegrated rechargeable battery (18500mWh) to extend your gaming sessions without frequent recharging.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEasy installation with a simple attachment system to the Meta Quest 3 or 3S headset.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eErgonomic design for better weight distribution, reducing pressure on your head during long sessions.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dobe","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47647987695838,"sku":null,"price":28.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_3033f570-82e4-48fe-a726-302306a779fc.jpg?v=1761949851"},{"product_id":"vr-controller-protective-silicone-cover-with-analog-grips-for-meta-quest-3-meta-quest-3s-controllers","title":"VR Controller Protective  Silicone Cover with Analog Grips For Meta Quest 3 \u0026 Meta Quest 3s Controllers","description":"\u003cp\u003eComfortable and practical VR Grips Cover with humanized design. Protects from scratching and smudging and has easy installation. Say goodbye to uncomfortable and unhygienic VR controllers.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dobe","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":47647999099102,"sku":null,"price":12.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":47647999000798,"sku":null,"price":12.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Turquoise","offer_id":47647998869726,"sku":null,"price":12.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Purple","offer_id":47647999033566,"sku":null,"price":12.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"White","offer_id":47647999066334,"sku":null,"price":12.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pink","offer_id":47647998902494,"sku":null,"price":12.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red","offer_id":47647998935262,"sku":null,"price":12.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_cfa1fddf-cb97-4185-af4e-03418257e459.jpg?v=1761951545"},{"product_id":"dobe-head-strap-for-meta-quest-3-meta-quest-3-ty-3861","title":"Dobe Head Strap for Meta Quest 3 \/ Meta Quest 3 TY-3861","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Dobe Head Strap for Meta Quest 3 (Model TY-3861) is designed to provide enhanced comfort and support during extended VR gaming sessions. Key features include:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eErgonomic Design: Offers adjustable head straps to fit different head sizes, ensuring a secure and comfortable fit.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImproved Stability: The strap provides better weight distribution, reducing pressure on the face and forehead.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnhanced Comfort: Soft, breathable materials prevent discomfort during long gaming sessions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEasy Adjustability: Quick and simple adjustments for a personalized fit.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDurable Build: Made with high-quality materials for long-lasting durability.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dobe","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47648004636894,"sku":null,"price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_82989aa5-85fe-4ed7-8271-ce171082654c.jpg?v=1761952952"},{"product_id":"kiwi-design-k4-duo-aio-comfort-audio-head-strap-with-battery-for-meta-3-3s","title":"KIWI design K4 Duo AIO Comfort Audio Head Strap with Battery for Meta 3 \u0026 3S","description":"\u003csection id=\"shopify-section-template--17854659919985__related_products_LtKXtT\" class=\"shopify-section shopify-section--product-recommendations\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section   section-blends section-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section-stack\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scrollable-with-controls\"\u003e\u003cscroll-carousel selector=\"product-card\" id=\"scroll-area-template--17854659919985__related_products_LtKXtT\" class=\"scroll-area bleed is-scrollable\"\u003e\u003creveal-items selector=\".product-list \u0026gt; *\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-style: solid; border-width: 0px; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12); opacity: 1;\"\u003e\u003cproduct-list class=\"product-list\"\u003e\u003cproduct-card handle=\"g4-max-extended-controller-grips\" class=\"product-card product-card--blends product-card--show-secondary-media text-custom is-selected\" samitapbl-element=\"handle\" p-handle=\"g4-max-extended-controller-grips\" p-variant-id=\"\" samitapbl-active=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product-card__info product-card__info--center\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"v-stack gap-0.5 w-full justify-items-center\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/KIWI_design_K4_Duo_Head_Strap_product_page-banner1-PC.jpg?v=1751017678\u0026amp;width=3200\" alt=\"KIWI_design_K4_Duo_Head_Strap_product_page-banner1-PC\" srcset=\"\/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/KIWI_design_K4_Duo_Head_Strap_product_page-banner1-PC.jpg?v=1751017678\u0026amp;width=200 200w, \/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/KIWI_design_K4_Du