:90.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_4d82e6f6-e9ae-4a42-8bd4-7047a70496e3.jpg?v=1764627559"},{"product_id":"kiwi-design-p4-carrying-case-compatible-with-meta-quest-3s-3-2-vision-pro-original-strap-and-touch-controllers-accessories-ideal-for-travel-and-home-storage","title":"KIWI design P4 Carrying Case Compatible with Meta Quest 3S\/3\/2\/Vision Pro Original Strap and Touch Controllers Accessories, Ideal for Travel and Home Storage","description":"\u003cp\u003eCrafted with premium thickness (10 mm) and a soft flannel lining, our case cradles your VR headset securely. A dedicated small pouch for accessories ensures they remain separate and scratch-free, keeping your device pristine, Note: Don't work with any elite\/halo or battery strap\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePortable and Space-Saving: Designed for travel, this compact, lightweight case (dimensions: 8.66*8.66*5.47 inch, weight: 11.16oz) fits effortlessly into your luggage or backpack. Unlike bulky alternatives, it provides sleek, space-efficient storage for your VR gear\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSmart Storage Solutions: Featuring meticulously organized compartments, this case offers dedicated space for all your essentials. Its intuitive layout ensures easy access and secure storage for your VR headset and accessories\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEco-Friendly Durability: Our case combines sustainability with durability and is made from over 55% RPET eco-friendly materials. It’s resistant to wear, water, and dust, providing long-lasting protection for your VR equipment\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePerfect Fit, Modern Style: Tailored for Meta Quest 3S\/3\/2 and Vision Pro original strap, this case offers a snug, secure fit with a modern, minimalist aesthetic that complements your VR headset’s design, merging function with fashion\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv lang=\"en_US\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-v2