v\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"KIWI Design","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":48191711543518,"sku":null,"price":30.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_802e8559-b07b-40e4-b209-3a6d362e0160.jpg?v=1777806398"},{"product_id":"k4-flex-comfort-elite-head-strap-for-meta-quest-3-3s","title":"K4 Flex Comfort Elite Head Strap for Meta Quest 3\/3S","description":"\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUpgrade your Meta Quest 3\/3S comfort with the KIWI design K4 Flex Head Strap.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIts wide, adaptive rear support and soft foam padding reduce pressure points for a more balanced fit.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe flat-back design lets you lie down comfortably without the usual “headset bump.”\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlexible elastic bands create a universal fit for kids, adults, and glasses wearers.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEasy to put on, quick to take off, and foldable for travel.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt with certified-safe, durable materials for long-lasting VR comfort.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003csection id=\"shopify-section-template--18883685810289__image_with_text_overlay_6eD4iM\" class=\"shopify-section shopify-section--image-with-text-overlay\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section   section-blends section-full text-custom\"\u003e\u003cimage-banner reveal-on-scroll=\"true\" class=\"content-over-media content-over-media--auto full-bleed  text-custom\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(max-width: 699px)\" srcset=\"\/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/KIWI_design_K4_Flex_Comfort_Elite_Head_Strap_SP1.jpg?v=1765507332\u0026amp;width=400 400w, \/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/KIWI_design_K4_Flex_Comfort_Elite_Head_Strap_SP1.jpg?v=1765507332\u0026amp;width=600 600w, \/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/KIWI_desi