sign_V4_Ventilation_Facial_Interface_PC_08.jpg?v=1733209470\u0026amp;width=1400 1400w, \/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/KIWIdesign_V4_Ventilation_Facial_Interface_PC_08.jpg?v=1733209470\u0026amp;width=1600 1600w, \/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/KIWIdesign_V4_Ventilation_Facial_Interface_PC_08.jpg?v=1733209470\u0026amp;width=1800 1800w, \/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/KIWIdesign_V4_Ventilation_Facial_Interface_PC_08.jpg?v=1733209470\u0026amp;width=2000 2000w, \/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/KIWIdesign_V4_Ventilation_Facial_Interface_PC_08.jpg?v=1733209470\u0026amp;width=2200 2200w, \/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/KIWIdesign_V4_Ventilation_Facial_Interface_PC_08.jpg?v=1733209470\u0026amp;width=2400 2400w, \/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/KIWIdesign_V4_Ventilation_Facial_Interface_PC_08.jpg?v=1733209470\u0026amp;width=2600 2600w, \/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/KIWIdesign_V4_Ventilation_Facial_Interface_PC_08.jpg?v=1733209470\u0026amp;width=2800 2800w, \/\/www.kiwidesign.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/KIWIdesign_V4_Ventilation_Facial_Interface_PC_08.jpg?v=1733209470\u0026amp;width=3000 3000w\" width=\"3000\" height=\"1230\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 740px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width: 999px) calc(100vw - 64px), min(1600px, 100vw - 96px)\" fetchpriority=\"low\"\u003e\u003c\/picture\u003e\u003c\/image-banner\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"KIWI Design","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":48191719506142,"sku":null,"price":25.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_b611a252-11ae-4399-86bb-8fc1f1d9ca94.jpg?v=1777809147"},{"product_id":"kiwi-design-f3-silicone-facial-interface-sweatproof-vr-face-cover-compatible-with-meta-quest-3-only","title":"KIWI design F3 Silicone Facial Interface, Sweatproof VR Face Cover Compatible with Meta Quest 3 Only","description":"\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMade for Meta Certified\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOfficially certified by Meta, this silicone facial interface meets the high-quality standards required for perfect compatibility with the Meta Quest 3, enhancing your VR experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect Fit for Meta Quest 3\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecifically designed for the Meta Quest 3, this face cover ensures a snug, secure fit that enhances comfort, allowing you to fully immerse in your virtual reality experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSkin-Friendly Silicone\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMade with ultra-soft, premium silicone, this face cover is gentle on sensitive skin and minimizes fatigue during extended VR sessions. It’s the perfect companion for hours of uninterrupted VR gaming.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEasy to Clean and Share\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSweat-resistant and simple to clean, this face cover ensures hygienic use, making it easy to share your Meta Quest 3 with friends and family without any hassle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFog-Free with No Nose Pressure\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSay goodbye to fogging and uncomfortable nose pressure with this thoughtfully designed silicone face pad, offering clear vision and maximum comfort throughout your VR sessions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick and Hassle-Free Installation\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAttach the VR cover effortlessly in seconds—no tools or complicated steps required, so you can dive straight into your VR \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv lang=\"en_US\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-v2 mobile celwidget\" cel_widget_id=\"m-aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"ex6tbb-1nodh9-ve7ern-gg763i\" data-cel-widget=\"m-aplus\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-content-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-2-fullbackground-image aplus-premium\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\" data-csa-c-id=\"dcapsc-v815on-jmo4c3-zefuz8\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"quest 3 face cover\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/fa578a02-ff9d-42c8-b566-05cf37a7961e.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\" class=\"background-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/fa578a02-ff9d-42c8-b566-05cf37a7961e.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-2-fullbackground-image aplus-premium\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\" data-csa-c-id=\"y03kai-mmbsfc-rsstpf-pq9zql\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"quest 3 face cover\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/416150f1-9014-48f6-a7ab-067ead188065.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\" class=\"background-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/416150f1-9014-48f6-a7ab-067ead188065.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=